<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls 2.7 points to 902.7.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls 2.7 points to 902.7.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 2.7 points on Wednesday to 902.7, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Three of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the banking index losing most, down 4.4 points to 1,336.9.</p>
<p>Seven indices rose, with the machinery index rising the most, up 7.4 points to 1,224.2.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
